#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Built-in notifications"
msgstr "Notificaziuns integradas"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ways Postulo can tell you, or a machine, that something happened without installing anything: a notification in your browser, an email, a signed message posted to an address. This is the switch for all three at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on. Switched off, none of them sends, and what was set up stays as it is."
msgstr "Las modas, co che Postulo As po infurmar, u infurmar ina maschina, ch'insatge è capità, senza installar insatge: ina notificaziun en Voss navigatur, in e-mail, in messadi suttascrit tramess ad ina adressa. Quai è il cumutatur per tut trais ensemen; mintgin po vegnir deactivà separadamain, er sch'el è activà. Sch'el è deactivà, na tramet nagin da quels nagut, e quai ch'è vegnì configurà resta sco ch'el è."
